### 1. GET Profile - devrait retourner user + stats + challenges + participations
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. PATCH Profile - mettre à jour username
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newusername"
}

### 3. PATCH Profile - mettre à jour email et password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newemail@example.com",
  "password": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 4. GET Profile après update
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
